You have just a certain fixed amount of time where the corpse is
fresh enough for the gods to be accepted.  Then "nothing happens"
as you observed.  It is best to kill the monsters in the same
room as the altar is.  You may also experiment to carry a corpse
through half of a dungeon level; watch the move counter how much
time you actually have.  Being unburdened helps.

